{
  "dom_id": "step-e14660",
  "name": "Example: Finding the Additive Inverse of a Larger Number",
  "problem": "Find the additive inverse of $23$ modulo $15.$",
  "worked_solution": "The additive inverse of $23$ modulo $15$ is the integer $0 \\leq x \\lt 15$ such that\n\n$$\nx + 23 \\equiv 0 \\quad (\\textrm{mod}\\:15).\n$$\n\nFirst, we note that $23\\equiv 8\\:(\\textrm{mod}\\:15){:}$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}23 & ≡1\\cdot 15+8 & \\,(\\text{mod}\\,15) \\\\  & ≡1\\cdot 0+8 & \\,(\\text{mod}\\,15) \\\\  & ≡8 & \\,(\\text{mod}\\,15)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAlso, note that $-8 + 8 \\equiv 0,$ so $x\\equiv -8\\:(\\textrm{mod}\\:15).$ To write this in the required form, we use the following sequence of congruences:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ≡-8 & \\,(\\text{mod}\\,15) \\\\  & ≡0-8 & \\,(\\text{mod}\\,15) \\\\  & ≡15-8 & \\,(\\text{mod}\\,15) \\\\  & ≡7 & \\,(\\text{mod}\\,15)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the additive inverse of the element $23$ modulo $15$ is $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}7}.$\n\nWe can verify this result as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}23+7≡30≡2\\cdot 15≡0\\,\\,✓\\,(\\text{mod}\\,15)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Note:** In general, the additive inverse of $a$ modulo $n$ is simply the residue of $-a$ modulo $n,$ i.e. $-a \\: \\textrm{mod} \\: n.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e14660\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Finding the Additive Inverse of a Larger Number</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e14660\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n               